I"\	<p align="justify">Our research is at the intersection of computational systems biology and systems medicine, mathematical biology, and bioinformatics. We work on the design, software development, and application of mathematical algorithms to model, simulate, and control biological systems. We place a particular emphasis on methods combining multi-omics profiles for static and dynamic data-driven model reconstruction, analysis, and control of gene regulatory networks.</p>

